
"smart_sources:2026-03-30 - ITD cites steep slopes for not bypassing Highway 55 past canyon (Conflicted copy Laptop (IdahoPTV) 202607081733).md": {"path":"2026-03-30 - ITD cites steep slopes for not bypassing Highway 55 past canyon (Conflicted copy Laptop (IdahoPTV) 202607081733).md","last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"last_read":{"hash":"zts520","at":1785795031790},"class_name":"SmartSource","last_import":{"mtime":1783553613443,"size":12089,"at":1785795031876,"hash":"zts520"},"blocks":{"#---frontmatter---":[1,9],"##Deep Dive: Widening Idaho 55 and replacing Rainbow Bridge will cost more than $100 million. Why not bypass the area?":[10,41],"##Deep Dive: Widening Idaho 55 and replacing Rainbow Bridge will cost more than $100 million. Why not bypass the area?#{1}":[12,41],"##Steep slopes, archeological digs and wildlife all impact project":[42,77],"##Steep slopes, archeological digs and wildlife all impact project#{1}":[44,77],"##What about the current construction challenges?":[78,112],"##What about the current construction challenges?#{1}":[80,112]},"outlinks":[{"title":"Margaret Carmel - BoiseDev","target":"Margaret Carmel - BoiseDev","line":5},{"title":"rockslides, and escalating costs to widen Idaho 55 in Valley County","target":"https://boisedev.com/news/members/idaho-55-slides-itd/","line":16},{"title":"Western States - Lookout creative - 4:1","target":"https://static-v2.boisedev.com/assets/115c0cfa-e547-4a5c-8f4e-7ea7e16f8bde.png","line":22,"embedded":true},{"title":"Valley Lookout house - generic","target":"https://static-v2.boisedev.com/assets/82689d5d-b8b7-4c7f-9d4c-b24100ffd632.gif","line":34,"embedded":true},{"title":"St. Luke's Health Plan - 2026 2:1","target":"https://static-v2.boisedev.com/assets/3cffa70b-bd30-43bc-8a9e-62008bbc7dff.png","line":50,"embedded":true},{"title":"St. Luke's Health Plan - 2026 2:1","target":"https://static-v2.boisedev.com/assets/3cffa70b-bd30-43bc-8a9e-62008bbc7dff.png","line":60,"embedded":true},{"title":"replace the Rainbow Bridge anyway","target":"https://valleylookout.com/2025/10/30/itd-growingly-concerned-about-future-of-historic-idaho-55-bridge-as-replacement-designs-narrowed/?preview=true&_thumbnail_id=5215","line":72},{"title":"St. Luke's Health Plan - 2026 2:1","target":"https://static-v2.boisedev.com/assets/3cffa70b-bd30-43bc-8a9e-62008bbc7dff.png","line":74,"embedded":true},{"title":"$62 million.","target":"https://boisedev.com/news/2022/09/19/idaho55-over-budget/","line":82},{"title":"multiple landslides at the project site that required redesigning the project and additional measures to stabilize the slopes","target":"https://boisedev.com/news/members/idaho-55-slides-itd/","line":82},{"title":"Rainbow Bridge for another $60 million","target":"https://valleylookout.com/2025/10/30/itd-growingly-concerned-about-future-of-historic-idaho-55-bridge-as-replacement-designs-narrowed/?preview=true&_thumbnail_id=5215","line":84},{"title":"St. Luke's Health Plan - 2026 2:1","target":"https://static-v2.boisedev.com/assets/3cffa70b-bd30-43bc-8a9e-62008bbc7dff.png","line":86,"embedded":true},{"title":"Highway 55 Smith's Ferry","target":"https://valleylookout.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/2/2024/11/Hwy55_SmithFerry_4-1500x783-1.jpg","line":94,"embedded":true},{"title":"flatten the","target":"https://boisedev.com/news/2022/09/19/idaho55-over-budget/","line":98},{"title":"highway curves enough to allow speeds up to 55 miles per hour,","target":"https://boisedev.com/news/2022/09/19/idaho55-over-budget/","line":98},{"title":"St. Luke's Health Plan - 2026 2:1","target":"https://static-v2.boisedev.com/assets/3cffa70b-bd30-43bc-8a9e-62008bbc7dff.png","line":100,"embedded":true},{"title":"St. Luke's Health Plan - 2026 2:1","target":"https://static-v2.boisedev.com/assets/3cffa70b-bd30-43bc-8a9e-62008bbc7dff.png","line":110,"embedded":true}],"metadata":{"title":"ITD cites steep slopes for not bypassing Highway 55 past canyon","source":"https://valleylookout.com/2026/03/30/idaho-55-reroute/","author":["[[Margaret Carmel - BoiseDev]]"],"published":"2026-03-30","created":"2026-07-07","description":"The Idaho Transportation Department — and Idaho’s drivers — have been contending with construction delays, rockslides, and escalating costs to widen Idaho 55 in Valley County for years. The winding two-lane highway, known for its eye-catching views as it wraps through the canyon between Cougar Mountain Lodge in Smiths Ferry and Round Valley, has been […]"},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},